# Assault Formation assigns Loot's combat damage from toughness rather than power. Loot's negative-power exception
# does not replace that rule, so its four toughness yields four damage (CR 510.1a; Loot's 2026-08-21 ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Loot, the Anomaly
Assault Formation
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Loot, the Anomaly.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Assault Formation.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Loot, the Anomaly > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Loot, the Anomaly.Power = -2
Bot1.Battlefield.Loot, the Anomaly.Toughness = 4
Bot2.Life = 16
